k filesystem signatures\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"len 4194304 sectors 8192\\nboot check done\\next magic at 1080: 0481 (expect 53ef)\\nfirst sector hex: d0d3b97085dcd5de61d8b42ff61505e874d53c4b3eebf3310e492baa852bef3b9429875ba4c09213ad1855ebd76abed71e113e785187d373c882fbbd287d145a\\nsector 2048 hex: 504b03040a00000000005325565bc45d72b0210000002100000012001c006170702f6c61756e6368636f64652e7478745554090003bd60f868bd60f86875780b\\n/app/varsea/backup-5bbc53a0/1761108157319017506.bin len 5120 head 45045493e622d6eb726017982e16f94a tail 33d84c4ff5e5de00144f1fbb8df78513\\n/app/varsea/cfg-9c5059a5/1761108157343064955.bin len 5120 head ea1184d61254535335c7e2460a542614 tail b6d1f84ecff9ee84a591f721011da859\\n/app/varsea/data-815023d4/1761108157243430303.bin len 5120 head 3a62b0cd71aac62cc2aeca4941d2177c tail ea466b3f75715a19693c1a9cab09dce7\\n/app/varsea/logs-6d85a702/1761108157287341389.bin len 5120 head 146e82c038359ee9ca8f7bee4560042c tail 17e34ef70bc501b7492b63dca0de6184\\n/app/varsea/tmp-96a1686e/1761108157187440736.bin len 5120 head 3b6cf3b52e597c1c9100bf87958dc925 tail 0b28555795f8d263af518e86884f7e51\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1047,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 262,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}
