"output\": \"run len 11 at 1048661: 8XDP5Q2RT9Z\\nrun len 12 at 3145728: K7VB3BV4WW54\\ndone runs, total printed 2\\nPWD at 1048652 hex 50415353574f52443d385844503551325254395a172aab9e2faeedeb29a12e0f9d808d4129990f89\\n=== bins uppercase runs ===\\n== /app/varsea/backup-5bbc53a0/1761108157319017506.bin ==\\n done 0\\n== /app/varsea/cfg-9c5059a5/1761108157343064955.bin ==\\n done 0\\n== /app/varsea/data-815023d4/1761108157243430303.bin ==\\n done 0\\n== /app/varsea/logs-6d85a702/1761108157287341389.bin ==\\n done 0\\n== /app/varsea/tmp-96a1686e/1761108157187440736.bin ==\\n done 0\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 546,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 137,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}
